WEBVTT

00:01:28.022 --> 00:01:30.752
You know, a coffee
that would be ideal for the mornings

00:01:30.776 --> 00:01:34.747
with the sole purpose of terrorizing
the body awake by its alarming taste.

00:01:34.771 --> 00:01:36.874
(Laughter)

00:01:36.898 --> 00:01:39.762
The second cup of coffee,
on the other hand,

00:01:39.786 --> 00:01:43.577
was both fruity and delightful.

00:01:43.601 --> 00:01:47.668
You know, coffee that one
can enjoy in the evening and relax.

00:01:49.466 --> 00:01:52.299
Little did my husband know, however,

00:01:52.323 --> 00:01:55.648
that I hadn't actually given him
the two types of coffee.

00:01:55.672 --> 00:01:58.810
I had given him the exact same
cup of coffee twice.

00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:01.001
(Laughter)